{"page":257,"verses":[{"verse_key":"14:11","surah":14,"ayah":11,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَتْ لَهُمْ رُسُلُهُمْ إِن نَّحْنُ إِلَّا بَشَرٌ مِّثْلُكُمْ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يَمُنُّ عَلَىٰ مَن يَشَآءُ مِنْ عِبَادِهِۦ ۖ وَمَا كَانَ لَنَآ أَن نَّأْتِيَكُم بِسُلْطَـٰنٍ إِلَّا بِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَعَلَى ٱللَّهِ فَلْيَتَوَكَّلِ ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Their messengers answered, ‘True, we are only men like you, but God favours whichever of His servants He chooses. We cannot bring you any proof unless God permits it, so let the believers put all their trust in Him-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَتْ","en_gloss":"Said","transliteration":"qālat","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":3,"ar":"رُسُلُهُمْ","en_gloss":"their Messengers","transliteration":"rusuluhum","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":5,"ar":"نَّحْنُ","en_gloss":"we (are)","transliteration":"naḥnu","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":6,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَشَرٌۭ","en_gloss":"a human","transliteration":"basharun","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّثْلُكُمْ","en_gloss":"like you","transliteration":"mith'lukum","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَمُنُّ","en_gloss":"bestows His Grace","transliteration":"yamunnu","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"14:11"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عِبَادِهِۦ 